{
  "schema": "medikiosk-interview/1",
  "comment": "Deterministic interview schema for the kiosk (Module A capture contract). Content is the production capture set; red-flag logic is in red_flags.json, ROS sets in ros.json. The UI hardcodes no question text, option, or order.",
