      "id": "socrates.exacerbating", "kind": "multi", "section": "symptoms", "field": "exacerbating",
      "ask": {
        "en": "What makes it worse, and what makes it better?",
        "hi": "किन चीज़ों से यह बढ़ती है, और किन से कम होती है?",
